WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:34.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.200
Black velvet, a million lights

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:43.000
Floating silent through the endless night

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.500
The world below, a sleeping blue

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.500
I'm holding my breath, I'm thinking of you

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.500
The signal's given, the turn is made

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.500
The point of no return, the course is laid

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:09.200
The fragile hull begins to shake

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.000
A promise that we're bound to make!

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:15.000
Telemetry rising on the glowing screen

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.800
Crossing the boundary of the unseen!

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:21.000
Here comes the friction, feel the fire!

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:24.200
Burning bright with our desire!

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.000
A halo of gold, a crimson glow

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:30.200
The only way we know to go!

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:36.200
We're coming home, we're breaking through

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:41.500
This atmosphere with you!

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:55.500
[Instrumental Break]

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:58.500
The pressure builds, the gauges hum

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.500
This is the gravity of what we've become

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:04.200
A silver spark in the upper air

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:07.000
Guided home because you're standing there!

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:10.000
Here comes the friction, feel the fire!

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:13.200
Burning bright with our desire!

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:16.000
A halo of gold, a crimson glow

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:19.200
The only way we know to go!

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:25.200
We're coming home, we're breaking through

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:30.500
This atmosphere with you!

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:36.800
Beyond the shadow, the edges blur

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:39.500
A wonder and a majesty

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:48.500
Shining through the clouds!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:03:13.000
[Synthesizer and Guitar Solo]

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:16.200
Here comes the friction, feel the fire!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:19.400
Burning bright with our desire!

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:22.200
A halo of gold, a crimson glow

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:25.400
The only way we know to go!

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:31.400
We're coming home, we're breaking through

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.600
This atmosphere with you!

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:38.200
Breaking through the atmosphere...

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:42.500
Coming home to you...

00:03:43.000 --> 00:04:22.000
[Outro]
